                     <ref target="https://papyri.info/biblio/52194">Sijpesteijn, P.J. (1977)</ref> “Addenda et Corrigenda zu Wiener Texten,” ZPE 24: 95–109.</bibl>
               </listBibl>
            </div>
         </div>
